ChangeScript:

Once you have selected the BBS script you wish changed,
you will be shown the BBS name, all the phone numbers
associated with that BBS and whether YOUR phone is
pulse or tone.

Just click in the field you wish change (or use the
RETURN/ENTER key) and make you're changes.

Once you are satisfied, just select ACCEPT. This will
delete the old script and replace it with your changes.
